      "cooked": "<p>I was watching the Season 2 GM Session #1 stream and they talked about the change to minions not auto dieing at a D4.&nbsp; It reminded me of another change that was discussed as part of Season 1 that I had thought at the time I needed to remember but I don't now (of course).&nbsp; I think it had to do with Exclusive Boosts/Hinders but I can't be sure.&nbsp; Does anyone remember or know what that might have been?&nbsp; I know it was discussed in the chat for the stream which of course isn't on the YouTube vids and a bunch of episodes are missing from Twitch.&nbsp; Thanks.</p>",
